      "%USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\history",
      "%USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\checkpoints"
    ],
    "bloatSource": "index",
    "tier": "yellow",
    "action": "clean",
    "notes": "checkpointing 影子 git 快照，可重建（损失 rewind 加速）。Gemini CLI 已退役（2026-06-18 个人账户停服），确认不再用可整目录处理。"
  },
  {
    "id": "gemini-cli-sessions",
